  "title": "Eggnog Snickerdoodles",
  "description": "This clever snickerdoodle recipe includes rum and brandy extracts with nutmeg to lend an eggnog flavor, perfect for the holidays!",
  "authors": [
    "SerrenaC23"
  ],
